message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PlainOntology: the ontology and semantic layer of a running system as one plain text file"
abstract: "PlainOntology extracts the implicit ontology of a running system (database schemas, JSON Schema, LLM tool definitions) into a plain text file, keeps hand-written semantic lines across re-extraction, reports drift, exports to OWL/SKOS and LinkML, and serves the file to AI agents over the Model Context Protocol."
authors:
